# Local provider plugin cache and working-directory state from running
# `terraform init`/`validate` during review. Never contains anything
# account-specific (this skeleton has never been applied against a real
# backend), but no reason to check in downloaded provider binaries.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
